                    "[Lentil].AboveGround.Wt as Lentil_BiomassWt",
                    "[Lentil].Grain.HarvestIndex as Lentil_HarvestIndex",
                    "mean of [Lentil].Leaf.Canopy.Fw from [Lentil].Sowing to [Lentil].Harvesting as Lentil_AvWaterStress",
                    "sum of [Irrigation].IrrigationApplied from [Lentil].Sowing to [Lentil].Harvesting as Lentil_Irrigation",
                    "sum of [Weather].Rain from [Lentil].Sowing to [Lentil].Harvesting as Lentil_Rain",
                    "first of [Manager].Script.PAW_800mm from [Lentil].Sowing to [Clock].Today as Lentil_WaterAtSowing",
                    "last of [Manager].Script.PAW_800mm from [Lentil].Sowing to [Clock].Today as Lentil_WaterAtHarvest",
                    "first of sum([Nutrient].NO3.kgha) from [Lentil].Sowing to [Clock].Today as Lentil_NO3AtSowing",
