                      "Text": "Soil Characterisation DB layers ( 100, 100, 300, 300, 300, 300 ) are not the same as soil.apsim ( 150, 150, 200, 300, 300, 400 ) layers - remapping\r\n\r\nISW is from site mean value",
                      "Name": "Soil Translation Notes",
                      "ResourceName": null,
